DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-CA:Brenda Jones :- School Visit (SV). Reviewed options f
 or regulation strategies to implement at  the  end of  morning  group meet
 ing daily. Discussed importance of practicing these regularly when in neut
 ral state so these can be easy to recruit in heightened states. Plan to se
 nd handout.\n\nRohan Khosh :- School Visit (SV). Set Rohan up in stander. Rohan 
 has grown over summer and is at the  end of range for Dondolino stander. H
 e cannot  achieve full extension at hips (approx. 160 deg.) or knees (160 
 deg.). plan to look for medium Easystand in OT/PT inventory. Suggested pau
 sing use of stander to Dave (teacher) until I can get a bigger one. Teleph
 one call to mum. Left voicemail  to update her.\n\nEsther Briggs :- School Visit
  (SV). Conducted Analysis of Sensory Behaviour Inventory with Brenda. Plan
  to score\, make suggestions.\n\nMandy Turner :-  School Visit (SV). Trialed stylu
 s access to touch screen on Elitebook vs. IdeaPad. Mandy was able  to acti
 vate touchscreen easier with stylus on IdeaPad. IdeaPad activated each tar
 get on initial touch whereas Elitebook occasionally required Mandy to repe
 at touch. Mandy also found smaller screen on IdeaPad helpful due to her li
 mited range of motion. Plan to write report recommending IdeaPad.\n
